('8161090633945','Blonde Perfecting Purple Shampoo','Moroccanoil','shampoo','shampoo','Fight brassiness in blonde, lightened brunette, and grey hair with this sulfate-free purple shampoo. Featuring deep violet pigments to counteract unwanted yellow and orange tones, this professional-strength tone-correcting shampoo helps you maintain your ideal haircolor between salon appointments. The gentle formula cleanses without drying and contains ArganIDTM to help repair hair from the inside out. Color-safe. Sulfate, phosphate, and paraben-free. In an independent consumer study of women ages 18-65 on the combined effects of Blonde Perfecting Purple Shampoo and Conditioner: 100% said hair feels soft* 96% said hair does not feel stripped or dry* 92% said highlights were refreshed* 85% said warmth is neutralized*','Fight brassiness in blonde, lightened brunette, and grey hair with this sulfate-free purple shampoo. Featuring deep violet pigments to counteract unwanted yellow and orange tones, this professional-strength tone-correcting shampoo helps you maintain your ideal haircolor between salon appointments. The gentle formula cleanses without drying and contains ArganIDTM to help repair hair from the inside out. Color-safe. Sulfate, phosphate, and paraben-free. In an independent consumer study of women ages 18-65 on the combined effects of Blonde Perfecting Purple Shampoo and Conditioner: 100% said hair feels soft* 96% said hair does not feel stripped or dry* 92% said highlights were refreshed* 85% said warmth is neutralized*','AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM C14-16 OLEFIN SULFONATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, COCAMIDOPROPYLAMINE OXIDE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, PEG-150 DISTEARATE, GLYCOL STEARATE, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, ALGIN, GLYCERIN, CHITOSAN, TRIDECETH-9, C12-13 PARETH-9, C11-15 PARETH-7, C12-16 PARETH-9, SILICA DIMETHYL SILYLATE, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, TRIDECETH-12, CITRIC ACID, COCONUT ACID, COCAMIDOPROPYL DIMETHYLAMINE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, SODIUM GLYCOLATE, CI 60730 (EXT. VIOLET NO. 2), TRIMETHYLSILOXYAMODIMETHICONE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, CHLORPHENESIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL. MOPPS02','Massage through wet hair and scalp. Leave on for 3-5 minutes. Rinse well. Follow with Moroccanoil Blonde Perfecting Purple Conditioner.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/purple-shampoo',4.7,3689,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/products/21_SHAMPOO_BLONDE-PERFECTING_200mL_v2_1.jpg?v=1683755398','data/images/shampoo/blonde_perfecting_purple_shampoo_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dầu gội','HC-8161090633945'),
('8161091289305','Clarifying Shampoo','Moroccanoil','shampoo','shampoo','Hair products, hard water and mineral deposits, chlorine and environmental impurities can all leave buildup over time—which can cause dull, greasy or limp hair. Moroccanoil® Clarifying Shampoo is a deep-cleansing formula that removes everyday buildup, restoring hair to a weightless, healthy balance. Rich in argan and avocado oils, keratin, lavender, chamomile and jojoba extracts, this clarifying shampoo nourishes your hair while gently cleansing impurities away. Color-safe. Sulfate-free, phosphate-free and paraben-free. • Removes 88% of oil* • Removes 88% of copper pollutants* • Removes 72% of aluminum pollutants* • Removes 52% of metals such as calcium and hard water mineral deposits* *Based on an independent lab study.','Removes 88% of oil*; Removes 88% of copper pollutants*; Removes 72% of aluminum pollutants*; Removes 52% of metals such as calcium and hard water mineral deposits*; Based on an independent lab study.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, COCAMIDOPROPYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, DISODIUM LAURETH SULFOSUCCINATE, SODIUM LAURYL SULFOACETATE, SODIUM LAUROYL SARCOSINATE, SODIUM CHLORIDE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL, CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT, LAVANDULA ANGUSTIFOLIA (LAVENDER) FLOWER EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED EXTRACT, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, SODIUM POLYSTYRENE SULFONATE, GLYCERIN, SODIUM SULFATE, PANTHENOL, COCAMIDOPROPYLAMINE OXIDE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, TETRASODIUM EDTA, SODIUM PCA, DISODIUM EDTA, CITRIC ACID, PEG-150 PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRASTEARATE, PEG-6 CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC GLYCERIDES, CINNAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, TETRASODIUM GLUTAMATE DIACETATE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM LAURATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL DIMETHYLAMINE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, SILK AMINO ACIDS, KERATIN AMINO ACIDS, MAGNESIUM CHLORIDE, MAGNESIUM NITRATE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, PHENOXYETHANOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, CHLORPHENESIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CI 19140 (YELLOW 5), CI 17200 (RED 33), ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL. MOCS03 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Massage through wet hair and scalp. Rinse well. Repeat if needed. Follow with your favorite Moroccanoil conditioner or mask. Use every two weeks, or up to once or twice weekly for those who use a lot of hair products, swim regularly, or have hard water.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/clarifying-shampoo',4.8,389,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/23_SHAMPOO_CLARIFYING_250mL_v2.jpg?v=1682817828','data/images/shampoo/clarifying_shampoo_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dầu gội','HC-8161091289305'),
('8161091485913','Color Care Shampoo','Moroccanoil','shampoo','shampoo','Extend the life of your color while improving hair’s integrity and boosting shine. This pH-balanced, sulfate-free shampoo gently cleanses while minimizing the absorption of substances that interact with color and is powered by proprietary technology to provide superior color retention. ArganIDTM helps repair and seal the cuticle to lock in color, while an Environmental Protection Blend combines the benefits of pomegranate extract and a sun protection quat to help protect against color loss and damage caused by sunlight and environmental aggressors. 90% of users noticed healthy-looking shine in just one use.* Sulfate, phosphate, and paraben-free. Bottles made of 50% post-consumer recycled material. PETA-certified cruelty-free.','Extend the life of your color while improving hair’s integrity and boosting shine. This pH-balanced, sulfate-free shampoo gently cleanses while minimizing the absorption of substances that interact with color and is powered by proprietary technology to provide superior color retention. ArganIDTM helps repair and seal the cuticle to lock in color, while an Environmental Protection Blend combines the benefits of pomegranate extract and a sun protection quat to help protect against color loss and damage caused by sunlight and environmental aggressors. 90% of users noticed healthy-looking shine in just one use.* Sulfate, phosphate, and paraben-free. Bottles made of 50% post-consumer recycled material. PETA-certified cruelty-free.','Our Color Care Shampoo and Conditioner are formulated with an Environmental Protection Blend containing pomegranate extract, which infuses antioxidants and polyphenols into the hair to combat the effects of environmental aggressors, as well as a sun protection quat that creates a protective veil around hair strands to absorb UV rays, helping to prevent damage and color degradation caused by sun exposure of the hair.','Massage through wet hair and scalp. Rinse well. Repeat if needed. Follow with Moroccanoil Color Care Conditioner.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/color-care-shampoo',4.8,313,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/25_SHAMPOO_COLOR-CARE_250mL_v2.jpg?v=1682817869','data/images/shampoo/color_care_shampoo_01.jpg',1,0,1,'Dầu gội','HC-8161091485913'),
('8210592465113','Curl Enhancing Shampoo','Moroccanoil','shampoo','shampoo','A curl-boosting shampoo with nourishing argan oil to restore elasticity, shine and manageability. Moroccanoil® Curl Enhancing Shampoo gently cleanses to reveal noticeably soft and smooth curls that are full of definition and free of unwanted frizz. A blend of hydrolyzed vegetable protein and Abyssinian oil strengthens and protects, for weightless curls that look and feel healthy with bounce and movement. Nourish the hair while achieving beautiful, natural and healthy looking curls with Moroccanoil’s Curl Enhancing Shampoo with argan oil.','A curl-boosting shampoo with nourishing argan oil to restore elasticity, shine and manageability. Moroccanoil® Curl Enhancing Shampoo gently cleanses to reveal noticeably soft and smooth curls that are full of definition and free of unwanted frizz. A blend of hydrolyzed vegetable protein and Abyssinian oil strengthens and protects, for weightless curls that look and feel healthy with bounce and movement. Nourish the hair while achieving beautiful, natural and healthy looking curls with Moroccanoil’s Curl Enhancing Shampoo with argan oil.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAUROYL METHYL ISETHIONATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM METHYL COCOYL TAURATE, SODIUM COCOYL ISETHIONATE, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, COCAMIDOPROPYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, CRAMBE ABYSSINICA SEED OIL, ACHILLEA MILLEFOLIUM (COMMON YARROW) EXTRACT, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED EXTRACT, MACROCYSTIS PYRIFERA (KELP) EXTRACT, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) LEAF EXTRACT, VITIS VINIFERA (GRAPE) SEED EXTRACT, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, SODIUM METHYL ISETHIONATE, POLYQUATERNIUM-6, LAURIC ACID, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CETYLPYRIDINIUM CHLORIDE, COCONUT ACID, POLYQUATERNIUM-53, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, LAURETH-4, ZINC LAURATE, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SODIUM LAURATE, GLYCERIN, SODIUM ISETHIONATE, POLYQUATERNIUM-55, HYDROLYZED VEGETABLE PROTEIN PG-PROPYL SILANETRIO