('8957889020121','Purifying Pre-Wash Scalp Scrub','Moroccanoil','shampoo','shampoo','Purify, refresh, and de-stress your scalp with Purifying Scalp Scrub. Formulated with argan shell powder to gently polish the scalp without the abrasive effects of some traditional exfoliants, this scrub effectively buffs away impurities that can negatively impact scalp and hair health over time, including dead skin cells, pollutants, and product buildup. Use before shampooing to reveal a softer, smoother scalp and bouncier, refreshed hair. • After just one use, 94% of participants showed reduction in buildup* • 100% agree scalp feels instantly relaxed** • 97% agree scalp condition is improved after 3 uses** • 95% agree scalp and hair feel refreshed** • 92% agree scalp is deeply cleansed** • Suitable for oily and dry scalps *Based on an independent lab study. **Based on an independent consumer test conducted on 38 respondents.','After just one use, 94% of participants showed reduction in buildup*; 100% agree scalp feels instantly relaxed**; 97% agree scalp condition is improved after 3 uses**; 95% agree scalp and hair feel refreshed**; 92% agree scalp is deeply cleansed**; Suitable for oily and dry scalps; Based on an independent lab study.; Based on an independent consumer test conducted on 38 respondents.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, STEARYL STEARATE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) SHELL POWDER, GLYCERIN, POLYSORBATE 20, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES (SEA BUCKTHORN) FRUIT OIL, VACCINIUM MYRTILLUS (BILBERRY) FRUIT EXTRACT, SWERTIA JAPONICA (SEMBURI) EXTRACT, ROSA CANINA (ROSE HIP) FRUIT OIL, ADANSONIA DIGITATA (BAOBOB) SEED OIL, FUMARIA OFFICINALIS (FUMITORY) EXTRACT, MELISSA OFFICINALIS (LEMON BALM) LEAF EXTRACT, SACCHARUM OFFICINARUM (SUGAR CANE) EXTRACT, ACER SACCHARUM (SUGAR MAPLE) EXTRACT, EUPHORBIA CERIFERA (CANDELILLA) WAX, CITRUS LIMON (LEMON) FRUIT EXTRACT, CITRUS AURANTIUM DULCIS (ORANGE) FRUIT EXTRACT, HORDEUM DISTICHON (BARLEY) EXTRACT, JOJOBA ESTERS, CELLULOSE, HYDROXYETHYLCELLULOSE, MENTHOL, GLUCONOLACTONE, COCAMIDOPROPYL DIMETHYLAMINE, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, MENTHYL LACTATE, DIPOTASSIUM GLYCYRRHIZATE, POLYQUATERNIUM-7, POLYSORBATE 60, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, GLUCOSYL HESPERIDIN, METHYLPROPANEDIOL, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, SODIUM CHLORIDE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CITRIC ACID, GLYCOLIC ACID, LACTIC ACID, SALICYLIC ACID, DIDECYLDIMONIUM CHLORIDE, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, SODIUM ACETATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, XANTHAN GUM, LINALOOL, LIMONENE. MOSDS01','Before shampooing, part wet hair into sections and apply to scalp. Add water, massaging gently and thoroughly. Rinse well. Follow with Moroccanoil Scalp Balancing Shampoo and Conditioner. Use weekly or as needed. Close cap tightly after use.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/purifying-pre-wash-scalp-scrub',4.8,115,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/D3271-MO.Com_Packshot_Scalp-Collection_SCALP_PURIFYING-SCRUB.jpg?v=1722881284','data/images/shampoo/purifying_pre-wash_scalp_scrub_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dầu gội','HC-8957889020121'),
('8957916152025','Scalp Balancing Shampoo','Moroccanoil','shampoo','shampoo','Healthy-looking hair starts with a balanced scalp. Scalp Balancing Shampoo gently yet effectively cleanses the scalp and hair without stripping natural oils, helping to reduce visible flaking and buildup while easing discomfort. Formulated with a potent blend of skincare-inspired ingredients—including gentle exfoliating salicylic and calming niacinamide—this purifying shampoo imparts optimal moisture to the hair and hydrates the scalp, leaving strands soft and the scalp balanced, calmed, and refreshed. Suitable for oily and dry scalps. Results based on consumer and instrumental testing after one use of Scalp Balancing Shampoo and Conditioner: • 95% of participants showed clinical reduction in oiliness* • 91% of participants showed clinical improvement in scalp hydration* • 88% of participants showed a reduction in flakes and residue* • 100% agree that their scalp and hair look and feel noticeably healthier over time** • 84% agree scalp discomfort is relieved** • 79% agree scalp itchiness is reduced** *Based on an independent lab study. **Based on an independent consumer test conducted on 38 respondents.','95% of participants showed clinical reduction in oiliness*; 91% of participants showed clinical improvement in scalp hydration*; 88% of participants showed a reduction in flakes and residue*; 100% agree that their scalp and hair look and feel noticeably healthier over time**; 84% agree scalp discomfort is relieved**; 79% agree scalp itchiness is reduced**; Based on an independent lab study.; Based on an independent consumer test conducted on 38 respondents.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM C14-16 OLEFIN SULFONATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, COCAMIDE METHYL MEA, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, LAURYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, TEA-COCOYL GLUTAMATE, POLYSORBATE 20, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, FUMARIA OFFICINALIS (FUMITORY) EXTRACT, HORDEUM DISTICHON (BARLEY) EXTRACT, MELISSA OFFICINALIS (LEMON BALM) LEAF EXTRACT, PRUNUS YEDOENSIS (CHERRY) LEAF EXTRACT, SWERTIA JAPONICA (SEMBURI) EXTRACT, MENTHOL, CITRIC ACID, DIPOTASSIUM GLYCYRRHIZATE, GLUCOSYL HESPERIDIN, NIACINAMIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, PEG-160 SORBITAN TRIISOSTEARATE, POLYQUATERNIUM-10, SALICYLIC ACID, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, DISODIUM EDTA, SODIUM ACETATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, SODIUM CITRATE, SODIUM DILAURAMIDOGLUTAMIDE LYSINE, PHENOXYETHANOL, LINALOOL, LIMONENE. MOSBS01','Massage through wet hair and scalp. Rinse well. Repeat if needed. Follow with Moroccanoil Scalp Balancing Conditioner.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/scalp-balancing-shampoo',4.5,136,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/SHAMPOO_SCALP_250mL_v3_sRGB190.jpg?v=1722883320','data/images/shampoo/scalp_balancing_shampoo_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dầu gội','HC-8957916152025'),
('8161091223769','Bordeaux Color Depositing Mask','Moroccanoil','hairmask','hairmask','Experience temporary color with the treatment benefits of a deep conditioning mask. Available in a range of curated shades, this easy-to-use mask makes it possible to experiment with fashion shades, enhance vibrancy and dimension or extend color between salon visits. It also contains nourishing ingredients including an amino acid blend, apricot kernel oil and reparative ArganIDTM technology for hair that looks and feels healthier. Color Depositing Mask packaging is made from 50% post-consumer recycled material, which helps to reduce our carbon footprint by consuming less energy. Bordeaux is a deep crimson brown for use on light brown to dark brown hair. Individual results will vary and depend on the starting condition and shade of hair; see the FAQ section of this page for details. To find your perfect shade, take our quiz. Please note that this product is not formulated to color greys. Color Benefits •Enhances tones •Refreshes existing haircolor •Customizes haircolor •Temporary results Care Benefits •Deep conditions •Instantly increases softness •Helps restore hair health •Imparts radiant shine','Enhances tones; Refreshes existing haircolor; Customizes haircolor; Temporary results; Deep conditions; Instantly increases softness; Helps restore hair health; Imparts radiant shine','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CETYL ALCOHOL, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PROPOXYTETRAMETHYL PIPERDINYL DIMETHICONE, PEG-12 DIMETHICONE, PRUNUS ARMENIACA (APRICOT) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, BIS-HYDROXY/METHOXY AMODIMETHICONE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, ALGIN, ARGININE, ASPARTIC ACID, GLYCINE, ALANINE, SERINE, VALINE, ISOLEUCINE, PROLINE, THREONINE, HISTIDINE, PHENYLALANINE, CHITOSAN, CITRIC ACID, ACETIC ACID, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROXYPROPYL STARCH PHOSPHATE, PANTHENOL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, BEHENTRIMONIUM METHOSULFATE, C11-15 PARETH-7, C12-13 PARETH-9, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, POLYQUATERNIUM-70, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, DISODIUM EDTA, QUATERNIUM-87, PCA, SODIUM PCA, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, TRIDECETH-6, SILICA DIMETHYL SILYLATE, CHLORPHENESIN, SODIUM ACETATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, SODIUM LACTATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CI 56059 (BASIC BLUE 99), CI 12250 (BASIC BROWN 16), BASIC RED 51, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL. MOCDMB03','Before committing to a full head of color, we recommend conducting a strand test first to assess the level of color deposition. Start by choosing a small piece of hair to test, ideally one that’s mostly hidden when your hair is styled normally. Section off the strand and tie the rest out of the way. Apply Color Depositing Mask on the strand and leave on 2–3 minutes. Rinse. If the color is too subtle, try a second strand and leave on for longer. For more details, visit the blog. 1. Start with clean, towel-dried hair. 2. Section hair and apply a generous amount. Distribute evenly using a wide-tooth comb. 3. Leave on for 5–7 minutes, depending on desired intensity. 4. Rinse thoroughly. Style as usual. Note: Color Depositing Masks add temporary color that is designed to fade out gradually over time. The lighter the hair, the more vibrant and long-lasting the shade. Color results and longevity also depend on hair porosity. To hit reset and expedite the color washout process, visit a Moroccanoil salon and consult with your stylist.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/bordeaux-color-depositing-mask',4.7,179,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/37_COLOR-DEPOSITING-MASK_BORDEAUX_200mL_v2.jpg?v=1682818453','data/images/masks/bordeaux_color_depositing_mask_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Ủ tóc','HC-8161091223769'),
