('8173172064473','High Shine Gloss Mask','Moroccanoil','hairmask','hairmask',NULL,'Experience glossy, mirror-like shine and instant softness for all hair types with this nourishing hair mask. The high-powered formula includes ArganIDTM technology to help repair and seal the cuticle for hair that’s silky soft and radiantly healthy-looking. This in-shower treatment also revitalizes haircolor between appointments and protects against color fading.* Sulfate, phosphate, and paraben-free. Packaging made from 50% post-consumer recycled materials. PETA-certified cruelty-free. After one use: • 95% agreed hair has a gloss-like finish** • 96% said hair looks and feels healthy** • 96% said hair feels richly conditioned** • 86% agreed shine was instantly boosted** *High Shine Gloss Mask protects against color fading, according to an independent lab study. **Based on results of a consumer study of women ages 18–65 on the effects of High Shine Gloss Mask. Loved Color Depositing Mask Clear? High Shine Gloss Mask features the same shine-boosting formula, with a new name and look!','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CETYL ALCOHOL, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, GLYCERIN, CRAMBE ABYSSINICA SEED OIL PHYTOSTEROL ESTERS, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROLYZED QUINOA, ALGIN, ARGININE, ASPARTIC ACID, GLYCINE, ALANINE, SERINE, VALINE, ISOLEUCINE, PROLINE, THREONINE, HISTIDINE, PHENYLALANINE, CHITOSAN, CITRIC ACID, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, LINOLEAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE DIMETHICONE, AMODIMETHICONE/MORPHOLINOMETHYL SILSESQUIOXANE COPOLYMER, HYDROXYPROPYLGLUCONAMIDE, HYDROXYPROPYLAMMONIUM GLUCONATE, HYDROXYPROPYL GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, DIMETHICONOL PANTHENOL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, C12-13 PARETH-9, CAPRLYLY GLYCOL, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, EDTA, PCA, SODIUM PCA, TRIDECETH-5, HEXYLENE GLYCOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, TARTARIC ACID, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM BENZOATE, SODIUM LACTATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, CLEAR POTASSIUM SORBATE, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL. MOCDMM03','After shampooing, rinse then squeeze out excess water. Apply a generous amount throughout hair, using a wide-tooth comb to distribute evenly. Leave on for 5–7 minutes. Rinse thoroughly.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/high-shine-gloss-mask',4.7,431,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/MASK_HIGH-SHINE-GLOSS-MASK_200ML_v3_CROP.jpg?v=1745841740','data/images/masks/high_shine_gloss_mask_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Ủ tóc','HC-8173172064473'),
('8161092894937','Intense Hydrating Mask','Moroccanoil','hairmask','hairmask','For dry strands in need of extra conditioning, this treatment mask is clinically proven to help deeply hydrate medium to thick hair. The ultra-rich and creamy formula only takes five minutes to penetrate deep into each hair strand, providing hydration and moisturization from the inside out. Rich in antioxidant argan oil plus nourishing ingredients to revive and revitalize dull, lifeless hair, leaving it softer, smoother, and shinier with improved manageability and texture. • Up to 6.5x more hydrated hair* • Up to 85% smoother hair* • Restores elasticity and shine • Treats in 5–7 minutes Winner, Reviewer''s Choice Awards: Best in Beauty, Best Luxury Hair Mask, Influenster.com, 2018 *Results based on an independent lab study.','Up to 6.5x more hydrated hair*; Up to 85% smoother hair*; Restores elasticity and shine; Treats in 5–7 minutes; Results based on an independent lab study.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, STEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCERIN, DIMETHICONE, CETYL ALCOHOL, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROXYPROPYL GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PANTHENOL, GLUCOSE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, PEG-100 STEARATE, POLYQUATERNIUM-37, PPG-1 TRIDECETH-6, STEARETH-2, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, CITRIC ACID, DISODIUM EDTA, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, SORBITAN OLEATE, STEARAMIDOPROPYL DIMETHYLAMINE, CHLORPHENESIN, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, CI 15985 (YELLOW 6), CI 19140 (YELLOW 5), ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL. MOIHM03 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.</p>','Apply a generous amount of Moroccanoil Intense Hydrating Mask to towel-dried hair and comb through. Leave on for 5-7 minutes and rinse thoroughly. No heat required. Use 1-2 times weekly. TIP: For deeper conditioning, mix in a few drops of Moroccanoil Treatment when using this hair mask.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/intense-hydrating-mask',4.8,2822,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/121_MASK_INTENSE-HYDRATING_250mL_v3.jpg?v=1682737044','data/images/masks/intense_hydrating_mask_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Ủ tóc','HC-8161092894937'),
('9820045770969','Overnight Leave-in Mask','Moroccanoil','hairmask','hairmask','Transform your hair while you sleep with Morccanoil Overnight Leave-in Mask—the ultimate solution for dry, dehydrated strands. This leave-in mask makes your morning routine effortless by reducing frizz, minimizing split ends, and preventing tangles while you sleep for lasting smoothness. Powered by argan oil, supercharged hyaluronic acid, and vegan snail mucin, this overnight treatment works while you sleep, leaving hair beautifully conditioned and touchably soft, with a healthy-looking shine. The weightless formula delivers intense hydration and deep nourishment without leaving residue on your hair or pillow. Increases hydration by 4x overnight* Hydration lasts for 3 washes** Hair is 3x easier to detangle in the morning* In a consumer study: •98% loved how easy the mask is to use •96% agreed hair looks and feels healthy •94% agreed hair has lasting smoothness •94% agreed this mask is comfortable to sleep in *Based on instrumental testing after eight hours. **Based on an independent lab study.','98% loved how easy the mask is to use; 96% agreed hair looks and feels healthy; 94% agreed hair has lasting smoothness; 94% agreed this mask is comfortable to sleep in; Based on instrumental testing after eight hours.; Based on an independent lab study.','Argan oil helps to nourish, supercharged hyaluronic acid (a blend of seven molecular weights) helps hydrate and soften, and vegan snail mucin helps condition and helps seal the cuticle to lock in moisture. The formula is vegan and cruelty-free.','Apply to damp or dry hair before bedtime, from mid-length to ends. No rinsing necessary. For fine hair, use 1–2 pumps. For medium hair, use 2–3 pumps. For thick or curly hair, use 3–4 pumps. Stylist Tip: Can also be used as a daytime treatment, especially for second-day or third-day hair to provide an instant boost of hydration.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/overnight-leave-in-mask',4.7,23,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/D4831-MO.Com_Packshots_ONH-Resize_FINAL_Full.jpg?v=1787921684','data/images/masks/overnight_leave-in_mask_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Ủ tóc','HC-9820045770969'),
('8161093517529','Platinum Color Depositing Mask','Moroccanoil','hairmask','hairmask','Experience temporary color with the treatment benefits of a deep conditioning mask. Available in a range of curated shades, this easy-to-use mask makes it possible to experiment with fashion shades, enhance vibrancy and dimension or extend color between salon visits. It also contains nourishing ingredients including an amino acid blend, apricot kernel oil and reparative ArganIDTM technology for hair that looks and feels healthier. Color Depositing Mask packaging is made from 50% post-consumer recycled material, which helps to reduce our carbon footprint by consuming less energy. Platinum is a cool, icy blonde for use on light blonde to medium blonde hair. Individual results will vary and depend on the starting condition and shade of hair; see the FAQ section of this page for details. To find your perfect shade, take our quiz . Please note that this product is not formulated to color greys. Color Benefits •Enhances tones •Refreshes existing haircolor •Customizes haircolor •Temporary results Care Benefits •Deep conditions •Instantly increases softness •Helps restore hair health •Imparts radiant shine','Enhances tones; Refreshes existing haircolor; Customizes haircolor; Temporary results; Deep conditions; Instantly increases softness; Helps restore hair health; Imparts radiant shine','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CETYL ALCOHOL, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PROPOXYTETRAMETHYL PIPERDINYL DIMETHICONE, PEG-12 DIMETHICONE, PRUNUS ARMENIACA (APRICOT) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, BIS-HYDROXY/METHOXY AMODIMETHICONE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, ALGIN, ARGININE, ASPARTIC ACID, GLYCINE, ALANINE, SERINE, VALINE, ISOLEUCINE, PROLINE, THREONINE, HISTIDINE, PHENYLALANINE, CHITOSAN, CITRIC ACID, ACETIC ACID, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROXYPROPYL STARCH PHOSPHATE, PANTHENOL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, BEHENTRIMONIUM METHOSULFATE, C11-15 PARETH-7, C12-13 PARETH-9, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, POLYQUATERNIUM-70, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, DISODIUM EDTA, QUATERNIUM-87, PCA, SODIUM PCA, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, TRIDECETH-6, SILICA DIMETHYL SILYLATE, CHLORPHENESIN, SODIUM ACETATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, SODIUM LACTATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CI 56059 (BASIC BLUE 99), CI 12245 (BASIC RED 76), ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL. MOCDMP03','Before committing to a full head of color, we recommend conducting a strand test first to assess the level of color deposition. Start by choosing a small piece of hair to test, ideally one that’s mostly hidden when your hair is styled normally. Section off the strand and tie the rest out of the way. Apply Color Depositing Mask on the strand and leave on 2–3 minutes. Rinse. If the color is too subtle, try a second strand and leave on for longer. For more details, visit the blog. 1. Start with clean, towel-dried hair. 2. Section hair and apply a generous amount. Distribute evenly using a wide-tooth comb. 3. Leave on for 5–7 minutes, depending on desired intensity. 4. Rinse thoroughly. Style as usual. Note: Color Depositing Masks add temporary color that is designed to fade out gradually over time. The lighter the hair, the more vibrant and long-lasting the shade. Color results and longevity also depend on hair porosity. To hit reset and expedite the color washout process, visit a Moroccanoil salon and consult with your stylist.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/platinum-color-depositing-mask',4.6,173,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/34_COLOR-DEPOSITING-MASK_PLATINUM_200mL_v2.jpg?v=1682818715','data/images/masks/platinum_color_depositing_mask_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Ủ tóc','HC-8161093517529'),
('8161094336729','Restorative Hair Mask','Moroccanoil','hairmask','hairmask','Moroccanoil Restorative Hair Mask is clinically proven to revitalize brittle, damaged hair. Tackle hair damaged by heat, chemicals, and other environmental stressors in just five minutes. The high-performance formula is rich with antioxidant argan oil and proteins to fortify each strand from the inside out, revive lackluster locks, and improve manageability and elasticity. • Results in 4x less breakage* • Restores hair for a healthier look and feel* • Reduces damage caused by chemical treatments* • Treats in 5–7 minutes • No heat required *Results based on an independent lab study.','Results in 4x less breakage*; Restores hair for a healthier look and feel*; Reduces damage caused by chemical treatments*; Treats in 5–7 minutes; No heat required; Results based on an independent lab study.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, CANOLA OIL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, DIMETHICONE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, CARYOCAR BRASILIENSE FRUIT OIL, HYDROLYZED VEGETABLE PROTEIN PG-PROPYL SILANETRIOL, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, TOCOPHEROL, SORBITAN OLEATE, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, CETEARETH-20, POLYQUATERNIUM-37, PPG-1 TRIDECETH-6, QUATERNIUM-98, STEARETH-2, CITRIC ACID, DIMETHICONOL, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, ACETAMIDE MEA, DISODIUM EDTA, CHLORPHENESIN, PROPYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, STEARAMIDOPROPYL DIMETHYLAMINE, POLYACRYLAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, DIHYDROGENATED TALLOW HYDROXYETHYLMONIUM METHOSULFATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, BHT, PHENOXYETHANOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL. MORHM03 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','For best results, after shampooing, apply a generous amount of Restorative Hair Mask all over hair and massage a little into the scalp. Leave on for 5-7 minutes. Rinse well. Use regularly on chemically compromised hair and decrease usage as hair''s texture and elasticity improve. For thick, coarse hair, mix about 1 teaspoon of Moroccanoil Treatment with Restorative Hair Mask for added shine and elasticity.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/restorative-hair-mask',4.8,877,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/134_MASK_RESTORATIVE_250mL_v2.jpg?v=1682736702','data/images/masks/restorative_hair_mask_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Ủ tóc','HC-8161094336729'),
