('8161095155929','Weightless Hydrating Mask','Moroccanoil','hairmask','hairmask','For finer hair in need of extra conditioning, this whipped formula feels lighter than air on the hair. Designed to hydrate and moisturize in only five minutes, while imparting lightweight softness and shine. Rich in antioxidant argan oil plus nourishing ingredients, dull, lifeless hair is instantly revived and revitalized. The result will be hair that looks shinier and feels softer without being weighed down. • Hydrates and nourishes • Restores elasticity • Improves manageability • Treats in 5–7 minutes','Hydrates and nourishes; Restores elasticity; Improves manageability; Treats in 5–7 minutes','AQUA/WATER/EAU, DIMETHICONE, STEARYL ALCOHOL, CETYL ALCOHOL, CANOLA OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, HYDROLYZED VEGETABLE PROTEIN PG-PROPYL SILANETRIOL, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, PEG-100 STEARATE, STEARETH-2, POLYQUATERNIUM-37, PPG-1 TRIDECETH-6, GLUCOSE, SORBITAN OLEATE, CITRIC ACID, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, PROPYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, STEARAMIDOPROPYL DIMETHYLAMINE, POLYACRYLAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, DISODIUM EDTA, ACETAMIDE MEA, CHLORPHENESIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL. MOWHM04 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.</p>','Apply a generous amount of Moroccanoil® Weightless Hydrating Mask to towel-dried hair and comb through. Leave on for 5-7 minutes and rinse thoroughly. No heat required. Use 1-2 times weekly. TIP: For deeper conditioning, mix a few drops of Moroccanoil Treatment in with this hair mask.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/weightless-hydrating-mask',4.7,1979,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/137_MASK_WEIGHTLESS-HYDRATING_250mL_v3.jpg?v=1682737957','data/images/masks/weightless_hydrating_mask_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Ủ tóc','HC-8161095155929'),
('8161090765017','Intense Smoothing Serum','Moroccanoil','treatment','treatment','Achieve polished, ultra-smooth curly or straight looks with this nourishing styling serum. The highly concentrated formula provides instant slip for easier brush glide and effortless styling and includes conditioning argan oil to boost softness and shine. Ideal for the unique needs of coarse, dull, or extremely frizzy hair. Reduces unwanted volume by 46%* Controls extreme frizz for up to 72 hours* Fragranced with the signature Moroccanoil scent, a Mediterranean-inspired blend of spicy amber and sweet floral notes. *Results based on an independent lab study.','Results based on an independent lab study.','CYCLOMETHICONE, DIMETHICONE, PHENYL TRIMETHICONE, BIS-VINYL DIMETHICONE, DIPHENYL DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE GLYCERIDES CITRATE, TOCOPHEROL, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, BETA-SITOSTEROL, GLYCERYL LINOLENATE, LECITHIN, HYDROGEN DIMETHICONE, SQUALENE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL. MOSC02','Distribute on damp hair from mid-length to ends. Style as desired. Apply on dry hair as a finisher for added shine and frizz reduction.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/intense-smoothing-serum',4.8,465,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/125_STYLE-FINISHER_INTENSE-SMOOTHING-SERUM_50mL_v2_2.jpg?v=1692804252','data/images/styling/intense_smoothing_serum_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dưỡng tóc','HC-8161090765017'),
('8161093288153','Moroccanoil Treatment Light','Moroccanoil','treatment','treatment','DISCOVER THE ORIGINAL Enjoy healthy, silky, shiny hair that''s full of life. Moroccanoil® Treatment Light is specifically formulated for the delicate needs of light-colored (including platinum and white) and fine hair. The original foundation for all hairstyles, Moroccanoil Treatment Light can be used as a conditioning and finishing tool all in one. Infused with antioxidant-rich argan oil and shine-boosting vitamins, this nourishing treatment detangles, speeds up drying time and boosts shine, leaving hair smooth and more manageable than ever before. Outshine the rest. Just one application of Moroccanoil Treatment Light increases hair''s shine by up to 118%, according to an independent study. AWARDS Beauty Awards, Harper''s Bazaar, 2017 Drop Dead Gorgeous, NYLON, 2017 Ultimate Hair Hydrator, New Beauty, 2016 Reviewer''s Choice Awards, Influenster.com, 2016 Favorite Oil, Stylist Choice Awards, 2016 Best of Black Beauty Award, Splurge Worth Hair Brand, Essence, 2016','DISCOVER THE ORIGINAL Enjoy healthy, silky, shiny hair that''s full of life. Moroccanoil® Treatment Light is specifically formulated for the delicate needs of light-colored (including platinum and white) and fine hair. The original foundation for all hairstyles, Moroccanoil Treatment Light can be used as a conditioning and finishing tool all in one. Infused with antioxidant-rich argan oil and shine-boosting vitamins, this nourishing treatment detangles, speeds up drying time and boosts shine, leaving hair smooth and more manageable than ever before. Outshine the rest. Just one application of Moroccanoil Treatment Light increases hair''s shine by up to 118%, according to an independent study. AWARDS Beauty Awards, Harper''s Bazaar, 2017 Drop Dead Gorgeous, NYLON, 2017 Ultimate Hair Hydrator, New Beauty, 2016 Reviewer''s Choice Awards, Influenster.com, 2016 Favorite Oil, Stylist Choice Awards, 2016 Best of Black Beauty Award, Splurge Worth Hair Brand, Essence, 2016','CYCLOMETHICONE, DIMETHICONE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, LINUM USITATISSIMUM (LINSEED) SEED EXTRACT, CI 26100 (RED 17), CI 47000 (YELLOW 11). MOTL01 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply 1–2 pumps of Moroccanoil® Treatment Light to clean, towel-dried hair, from mid-length to ends. Blow-dry or let dry naturally. Apply on dry hair to tame flyaways, condition split ends and smooth hair. TIP: Mix a few drops of Moroccanoil Treatment with Moroccanoil Intense Hydrating Mask, Weightless Hydrating Mask or Restorative Hair Mask for added nourishment.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/moroccanoil-treatment-light',4.8,2922,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/124_TREATMENT_LIGHT_100mL_v3_1.jpg?v=1774983318','data/images/treatment_oil/moroccanoil_treatment_light_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dưỡng tóc','HC-8161093288153'),
('9280645595353','Moroccanoil Treatment Mist','Moroccanoil','treatment','treatment','Experience the haircare benefits you know and love, now in a light-as-air dry oil spray. Moroccanoil Treatment Mist is the ultra-lightweight foundation for all styling—a single product that creates long-lasting smoothness, increases manageability, speeds up blow-drying time, and increases shine by up to 141%.* With its unique alcohol-free formula, this spray provides all of the shine, nourishment, and hydration benefits of oils, without making the hair feel weighed down or leaving any greasy residue. • Weightless, cloud-like mist • Hands-free spray application • Adds nourishment to second-day hair • Great for refreshing curls, coils, and spirals • Protects against thermal damage** In a consumer study: • 100% agreed hair looks and feels healthy • 100% agreed product refreshes curls and coils • 95% agreed hair does not feel weighed down • 92% of fine-haired clients said this product is a staple in their daily routine *Based on an independent lab study. **Based on instrumental testing.','Weightless, cloud-like mist; Hands-free spray application; Adds nourishment to second-day hair; Great for refreshing curls, coils, and spirals; Protects against thermal damage**; 100% agreed hair looks and feels healthy; 100% agreed product refreshes curls and coils; 95% agreed hair does not feel weighed down; 92% of fine-haired clients said this product is a staple in their daily routine; Based on an independent lab study.; Based on instrumental testing.','ISODODECANE, TRISILOXANE, DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, LINUM USITATISSIMUM (LINSEED) SEED EXTRACT, ORYZA SATIVA (RICE) BRAN EXTRACT, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, TOCOPHEROL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, HEPTYL UNDECYLENATE, C13-15 ALKANE, CI 26100 (RED 17), CI 47000 (YELLOW 11), LINALOOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, HEXAMETHYLINDANOPYRAN, LINALYL ACETATE, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, VANILLIN, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS OIL, LAVANDULA (LAVENDER) OIL/EXTRACT, MENTHA VIRIDIS (SPEARMINT) LEAF OIL, ISOEUGENYL ACETATE, CAMPHOR, CARVONE. MOTMUL02','Designed to be used on both wet and dry hair, the Moroccanoil Treatment Mist sprayer makes it easy to customize the amount of product needed for anyone to achieve healthy-looking styles. Wet Hair: Spray onto damp hair from mid-length to ends as the foundation for all styling, to increase manageability, and to prepare the hair for blow-drying. Blow-dry or style as usual. Dry Hair: Spray onto dry hair from mid-length to ends, to help smooth strands and eliminate frizz. Provides long-lasting shine while taming flyaways.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/moroccanoil-treatment-mist',4.8,998,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/TREATMENT-MIST_100ML_v3.jpg?v=1754920313','data/images/treatment_oil/moroccanoil_treatment_mist_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dưỡng tóc','HC-9280645595353'),
('8161093353689','Moroccanoil Treatment Original','Moroccanoil','treatment','treatment','Get the silky, shiny and healthy hair you''ve always wanted. Moroccanoil Treatment is the product that pioneered oil-infused hair care and created the worldwide buzz on argan oil. The original foundation for all hairstyles, Moroccanoil Treatment can be used as a conditioning and finishing tool. Infused with antioxidant-rich argan oil and shine-boosting vitamins, this completely transformative hair treatment detangles, speeds up drying time and boosts shine—leaving you with nourished, manageable, and smooth hair with each use. Just one application of Moroccanoil Treatment increases hair''s shine by up to 118%, according to an independent study. Greatest of All Time: Hair WWD- Beauty INC 2025 Allure Readers'' Choice Award Allure Elle Beauty 2025 Forever Favorites Elle Women''s Health Beauty Awards ''Best Hair Mist'' Women''s Health 2024 Best Leave-In Treatment Glamour Best of the Best Awards 2023 Harper''s Bazaar #1 Hair Oil* *Circana, US Prestige Beauty TMM, Hair Oil, Dollars, Jan-Jun ‘26','Circana, US Prestige Beauty TMM, Hair Oil, Dollars, Jan-Jun ‘26','CYCLOMETHICONE, DIMETHICONE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, LINUM USITATISSIMUM (LINSEED) SEED EXTRACT, CI 26100 (RED 17), CI 47000 (YELLOW 11). MOT01 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply a small amount to clean, towel-dried hair, from mid-length to ends. Blow-dry or let dry naturally. Apply on dry hair to tame flyaways, condition split ends and smooth hair. TIP: Mix a few drops of Moroccanoil Treatment with Moroccanoil Intense Hydrating Mask, Weightless Hydrating Mask or Restorative Hair Mask for added nourishment.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/moroccanoil-treatment-original',4.9,9257,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/153_