('8672695582937','Moroccanoil Treatment Purple','Moroccanoil','treatment','treatment','Say goodbye to brassiness. The Moroccanoil Treatment that you know and love now formulated with tone-correcting violet pigments. Specially created for the needs of blonde, highlighted, and grey hair to neutralize brassiness and counteract unwanted yellow and orange hues over time. This rich yet lightweight argan oil-infused formula instantly absorbs into the hair to immediately enhance manageability, shine, and deliver long-term conditioning and softness without leaving residue. Complete with both styling and conditioning benefits, Moroccanoil Treatment Purple is a must in all styling and salon services—a single product that counteracts unwanted brassy hues over time, instantly restoring vibrancy and radiance, while creating long-lasting smoothness, increasing manageability, speeding up blow-dry time, and boosting shine. • Neutralizes brassiness over time • Multitasking, lightweight formula with argan oil and linseed extract • Protects against thermal damage** • Helps hair look and feel healthier • 95% of consumers surveyed said that Moroccanoil Treatment Purple refreshes highlights in just one use!* In a consumer perception study conducted after one week of consistent use: • 95% said the product reduces brassiness* • 95% said the product helps maintain blonde tones between salon appointments* • 95% said the product is a game changer* • 91% said the product is essential to their blonde care routine* *Based on results of an independent consumer test conducted on 75 respondents. **Based on instrument testing.','Neutralizes brassiness over time; Multitasking, lightweight formula with argan oil and linseed extract; Protects against thermal damage**; Helps hair look and feel healthier; 95% of consumers surveyed said that Moroccanoil Treatment Purple refreshes highlights in just one use!*; 95% said the product reduces brassiness*; 95% said the product helps maintain blonde tones between salon appointments*; 95% said the product is a game changer*; 91% said the product is essential to their blonde care routine*; Based on results of an independent consumer test conducted on 75 respondents.; Based on instrument testing.','Cyclomethicone, Dimethicone, Parfum/Fragrance, Diethylhexyl Sodium Sulfosuccinate, Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil, Linum Usitatissimum (Linseed) Seed Extract, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Cl 60730 (Ext. Violet No. 2), Cl 60725 (Violet 2)','Apply a small amount throughout damp or dry hair. Style as usual. Use 2–3 times a week or as needed. Use consistently over time for maximum results. For enhanced toning, use with Moroccanoil Blonde Perfecting Purple Shampoo and Conditioner. Note: Individual toning results may vary due to hair condition, starting color, porosity, and other factors. Apply to damp hair as the foundation for all hairstyling. Apply to dry hair to help smooth frizz.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/moroccanoil-treatment-purple',4.8,372,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/TREATMENT_PURPLE_50mL_v3_sRGB190.jpg?v=1774983445','data/images/treatment_oil/moroccanoil_treatment_purple_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dưỡng tóc','HC-8672695582937'),
('8161091748057','Dry Shampoo Dark Tones','Moroccanoil','dry shampoo','dry shampoo','Hair color is personal. Dry shampoo should be too. Moroccanoil Dry Shampoo is a dry cleansing spray that instantly refreshes and revitalizes the hair and scalp to extend the life of your style. This powerful cleanser is formulated with ultra-fine rice starches that break down immediately after being massaged into the scalp, absorbing oil and product buildup without leaving behind a dull residue. Hair is left refreshed and cleansed with a silky, just-left-the-salon feel. While traditional dry shampoo formulas remain in the hair and leave a white residue that diminishes natural vibrancy and shine, our Dry Shampoo for Dark Tones features a subtle tint and instantly dissipating formula to maintain the natural richness and dimension of dark hair. Also available in Light Tones! • Removes up to 85% of oil from hair* • Argan oil-infused • Protects against UV damage • Leaves no chalky, dull residue • Instantly refreshes and cleanses • Deodorizes, leaving behind the signature Moroccanoil scent • Silky finish','Removes up to 85% of oil from hair*; Argan oil-infused; Protects against UV damage; Leaves no chalky, dull residue; Instantly refreshes and cleanses; Deodorizes, leaving behind the signature Moroccanoil scent; Silky finish','HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152A, BUTANE, ORYZA SATIVA (RICE) STARCH, SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), DISILOXANE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PVP, AQUA/WATER/EAU, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, DIISOPROPYL ADIPATE, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, METHOXYCINNAMIDOPROPYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499). Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Shake well. Spray 6-8 inches (15-20 cm) away from dry roots. Let dry, then massage into scalp as you would with wet shampoo. Brush out.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/dry-shampoo-dark-tones',4.8,862,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/45_DRY-SHAMPOO_DARK-TONES_205mL_v2.jpg?v=1682737243','data/images/dry_shampoo/dry_shampoo_dark_tones_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Dầu gội khô','HC-8161091748057'),
('8161091780825','Dry Shampoo Light Tones','Moroccanoil','dry shampoo','dry shampoo','Hair color is personal. Dry shampoo should be too. Moroccanoil Dry Shampoo is a dry cleansing spray that instantly refreshes and revitalizes the hair and scalp to extend the life of your style. Formulated with ultra-fine rice starches, this powerful cleanser dissipates instantly to absorb oil and product buildup without leaving behind a dull residue. Hair is left refreshed and cleansed with a silky, just-left-the-salon feel. Paralleling the concept of the purple “wet” shampoo, our Dry Shampoo for Light Tones is formulated with subtle violet undertones to help balance brassiness. Also available in Dark Tones! • Removes up to 85% of oil from hair* • Argan oil-infused • Protects against UV damage • Leaves no chalky, dull residue • Instantly refreshes and cleanses • Deodorizes, leaving behind the signature Moroccanoil scent • Silky finish','Removes up to 85% of oil from hair*; Argan oil-infused; Protects against UV damage; Leaves no chalky, dull residue; Instantly refreshes and cleanses; Deodorizes, leaving behind the signature Moroccanoil scent; Silky finish','HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152A, BUTANE, ORYZA SATIVA (RICE) STARCH, SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), DISILOXANE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PVP, AQUA/WATER/EAU, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, DIISOPROPYL ADIPATE, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, METHOXYCINNAMIDOPROPYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, CI 60725 (VIOLET 2), CI 17200 (RED 33). Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Shake well. Spray 6-8 inches (15-20 cm) away from dry roots. Let dry, then massage into scalp as you would with wet shampoo. Brush out.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/dry-shampoo-light-tones',4.9,881,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/46_DRY-SHAMPOO_LIGHT-TONES_205mL_v2.jpg?v=1682737167','data/images