('8161091584217','Curl Control Mousse','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Control curly, coily and tightly-spiraled hair with no crunch: Moroccanoil Curl Control Mousse tames, defines and provides hold for hours, sealing in moisture and preventing frizzy hair in any weather. Lightweight yet powerful formula infused with argan oil provides soft, smooth hair with a natural texture and no sticky residue.','Control curly, coily and tightly-spiraled hair with no crunch: Moroccanoil Curl Control Mousse tames, defines and provides hold for hours, sealing in moisture and preventing frizzy hair in any weather. Lightweight yet powerful formula infused with argan oil provides soft, smooth hair with a natural texture and no sticky residue.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, COCAMIDOPROPYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, POLYSORBATE 20, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, POLYQUATERNIUM-72, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROLYZED VEGETABLE PROTEIN PG-PROPYL SILANETRIOL, POLYQUATERNIUM-11, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYETHANOL, TETRASODIUM EDTA, CITRIC ACID, CHLORPHENESIN, POLYQUATERNIUM-70, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL. Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply a generous amount to clean, towel-dried hair. For best results, gently scrunch hair with hands from ends, lifting toward the roots, and allow hair to dry naturally. TIP: Reapply to dry hair throughout the day or the next day to refresh curls, reduce frizz and revive hair.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/curl-control-mousse',4.4,288,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/107_STYLE-FINISHER_CURL-CONTROL-MOUSSE_150mL_v3.jpg?v=1683622337','data/images/styling/curl_control_mousse_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161091584217'),
('8161091616985','Curl Defining Cream','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Put your best curl forward. This all-in-one curl solution replaces regular cocktailing of a gel, mousse, or serum. Argan oil-infused formula increases bounce and movement of naturally curly and wavy hair for frizz-free curls with improved shape and separation. It defines and enhances the curl pattern, while softening texture with a gentle, touchable hold. • 48-hour curl definition* • Conditions and provides soft hold • Combats frizz • Imparts shine • Leaves curls silky smooth • Increases bounce and movement Winner, Curl Defining, 2022, 2019 Allure Readers'' Choice Awards *Based on an independent lab study.','48-hour curl definition*; Conditions and provides soft hold; Combats frizz; Imparts shine; Leaves curls silky smooth; Increases bounce and movement; Based on an independent lab study.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCOL STEARATE, CETYL ALCOHOL, BEHENTRIMONIUM METHOSULFATE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, DIMETHICONE, PHENYL TRIMETHICONE, POLYQUATERNIUM-11, STEARETH-2, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROLYZED VEGETABLE PROTEIN PG-PROPYL SILANETRIOL, CELLULOSE, HYDROXYETHYLCELLULOSE, PG-HYDROXYETHYLCELLULOSE COCODIMONIUM CHLORIDE, GLUCOSE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, SORBITAN OLEATE, DIPHENYL DIMETHICONE, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, POLYQUATERNIUM-10, POLYQUATERNIUM-37, POLYQUATERNIUM-55, PPG-1 TRIDECETH-6, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, CITRIC ACID, DISODIUM EDTA, C10-40 ISOALKYLAMIDOPROPYLETHYLDIMONIUM ETHOSULFATE, SODIUM ACETATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CHLORPHENESIN, PHENOXYETHANOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL BENZOATE, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL, LINALOOL. MOCDC04 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply 1-2 pumps to towel-dried hair. Distribute product throughout hair and diffuse to activate and define curls. For a more relaxed curl, let hair dry naturally.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/curl-defining-cream',4.8,2040,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/106_STYLE-FINISHER_CURL-DEFINING-CREAM_250mL_v2.jpg?v=1682737780','data/images/styling/curl_defining_cream_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161091616985'),
('8161091813593','Dry Texture Spray','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','A dry argan-oil infused texture spray for effortless, undone styles with long-lasting hold. Use Moroccanoil® Dry Texture Spray as a finishing spray for styles with carefree, textured volume. Can also be used as a prep spray to provide foundational grip needed for no-slip braids and updos. A particle matrix of high-performance resins and zeolite form a bond between hairs for a texturized hold with a dry, gritty finish. AWARD New Beauty Choice Awards, New Beauty, 2017','A dry argan-oil infused texture spray for effortless, undone styles with long-lasting hold. Use Moroccanoil® Dry Texture Spray as a finishing spray for styles with carefree, textured volume. Can also be used as a prep spray to provide foundational grip needed for no-slip braids and updos. A particle matrix of high-performance resins and zeolite form a bond between hairs for a texturized hold with a dry, gritty finish. AWARD New Beauty Choice Awards, New Beauty, 2017','HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152A, BUTANE, SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), VP/VA COPOLYMER, ZEOLITE, ISOBUTANE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, AQUA/WATER/EAU, ACETYL TRIETHYL CITRATE, GLYCERIN, PEG/PPG-17/18 DIMETHICONE, AMP-ISOSTEAROYL HYDROLYZED WHEAT PROTEIN, METHOXYCINNAMIDOPROPYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, BENZOIC ACID, EDTA, PHENOXYETHANOL. MOTS03 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Shake well. Spray on dry hair.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/dry-texture-spray',4.7,653,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/47_STYLE-FINISHER_DRY-TEXTURE-SPRAY_205mL_v3.jpg?v=1682737130','data/images/styling/dry_texture_spray_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161091813593'),
('8229545836761','Frizz Shield Spray','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','This heat-activated spray eases the styling process while providing a defensive shield for long-lasting frizz, static, and flyaway control. The weightless formula helps protect against thermal damage and includes antioxidant-rich argan oil and other naturally derived and upcycled ingredients to care for hair from the inside out, leaving it silky, soft, smooth, and glass-like—without a sticky finish or film. Powered by HydroResist Technology, which wraps strands in a hydrophobic conditioning veil that repels humidity and other environmental elements for perfectly styled hair that lasts for days. Protects against up to 90% humidity* 94% said it’s the best anti-frizz product** 98% said the hair is shiny and smooth** 99% said the hair is soft** 96% said product provides salon-worthy results** Fragranced with the Moroccanoil signature scent, a Mediterranean-inspired blend of spicy amber and sweet floral notes. *Results based on an independent lab study. **Study of women ages 18-65.','Results based on an independent lab study.; Study of women ages 18-65.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, POLYSILICONE-29, SILICONE QUATERNIUM-18, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, ARTOCARPUS HETEROPHYLLUS (JACKFRUIT) FRUIT EXTRACT, AMARANTHUS CAUDATUS (AMARANTH) SEED EXTRACT, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, POLYSORBATE 20, TRIDECETH-12, METHYLPROPANEDIOL, TRIDECETH-6, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, GLYCOLIC ACID, POLYQUATERNIUM-80, CITRIC ACID, C12-13 PARETH-9, HYDROLYZED QUINOA, SODIUM PCA, SODIUM LACTATE, DIDECYLDIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ARGININE, ASPARTIC ACID, POTASSIUM HYDROXIDE, PCA, LACTOBACILLUS FERMENT, GLYCINE, ALANINE, ALGIN, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, CHITOSAN, SERINE, VALINE, ISOLEUCINE, PROLINE, THREONINE, HISTIDINE, PHENYLALANINE, PHENOXYETHANOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, LINALOOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE. MOAHS02','Spray throughout clean, damp hair. Comb to distribute evenly and blow-dry in sections to activate. Follow with a flat iron for enhanced anti-frizz benefits. Frizz Shield Spray should be the last product applied before blow-drying for optimal heat activation.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/frizz-shield-spray',4.6,818,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/109_STYLE-FINISHER_FRIZZ-SHIELD-SPRAY_160mL_v3_1.jpg?v=1692116524','data/images/styling/frizz_shield_spray_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8229545836761'),
('8161092796633','Hydrating Styling Cream','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','For the perfect blow-dry, Moroccanoil Hydrating Styling Cream combines the extraordinary conditioning properties of antioxidant-rich argan oil and a soft hold—resulting in a product that is highly effective in creating smooth styles, and versatile enough for all hair types. • Improves softness by 74%* • Provides soft hold • Adds definition • Hydrates • Leaves hair smooth • Combats frizz and the effects of humidity Winner, Total Beauty Award, 2018 *Based on an independent lab study.','Improves softness by 74%*; Provides soft hold; Adds definition; Hydrates; Leaves hair smooth; Combats frizz and the effects of humidity; Based on an independent lab study.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, DIMETHICONE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, ORYZA SATIVA (RICE) BRAN EXTRACT, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, GLYCERYL STEARATE SE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CHLORPHENESIN, CITRIC ACID, TOCOPHEROL, CARAMEL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL, LIMONENE. MOHSC05 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply 1-2 pumps of Moroccanoil® Hydrating Styling Cream to damp or dry hair from mid-length to ends. Blow-dry and style as usual or allow hair to dry naturally. TIP: For very thick, unmanageable or frizzy hair, mix 1-2 pumps with a few drops of Moroccanoil Treatment to tame and condition.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/hydrating-styling-cream',4.8,2814,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/104_STYLE-FINISHER_HYDRATING-STYLE-CREAM_300mL_v3.jpg?v=1682737730','data/images/styling/hydrating_styling_cream_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161092796633'),
('8161092862169','Intense Curl Cream','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','For natural curls and waves that look shiny, shapely and beautifully refreshed, Moroccanoil® Intense Curl Cream is a leave-in conditioner that moisturizes and fights stubborn frizz without stickiness. Infused with nourishing argan oil and vitamins to keep wavy and curly hair looking hydrated and touchably soft all day.','For natural curls and waves that look shiny, shapely and beautifully refreshed, Moroccanoil® Intense Curl Cream is a leave-in conditioner that moisturizes and fights stubborn frizz without stickiness. Infused with nourishing argan oil and vitamins to keep wavy and curly hair looking hydrated and touchably soft all day.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETYL ALCOHOL, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, DIMETHICONE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, GLYCERYL DISTEARATE, RICINUS COMMUNIS (CASTOR) SEED OIL, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES (SEA BUCKTHORN) FRUIT OIL, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, POLYQUATERNIUM-7, STEARIC ACID, GLYCERIN, ILLITE, SODIUM STEARATE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, MYRISTYL ALCOHOL, STEARYL ALCOHOL, CITRIC ACID, TOCOPHEROL, CHLORPHENESIN, SODIUM BENZOATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL, LINALOOL, BENZYL BENZOATE, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE. MOlCC03 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply one pump (or more, depending on hair length and texture) of Moroccanoil® Intense Curl Cream throughout damp or dry strands. Style as usual, or let hair dry naturally. TIP: If desired, gently work into dry hair throughout the day to refresh curls and control frizz.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/intense-curl-cream',4.7,662,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/103_STYLE-FINISHER_INTENSE-CURL-CREAM_300mL_v3.jpg?v=1683622662','data/ima