('8161093058777','Luminous Hairspray Medium','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','This medium hold, flexible hairspray provides long-lasting, weightless hold for soft and natural styles. Moroccanoil® Luminous Hairspray Medium is a lightweight and workable hairspray that veils hair in a reflective shield of shine that fights frizz and humidity, yet brushes out easily and leaves no sticky or flaky residue. Infused with a combination of advanced ingredients, including nourishing antioxidant-rich argan oil. Medium hold is ideal for natural styles, including easy updos (such as ballerina buns and ponytails) and blowouts. AWARDS Best High-Humidity Hairspray, InStyle.com, 2017 TotalBeauty Awards: Best Hair Products TotalBeauty.com, 2017','This medium hold, flexible hairspray provides long-lasting, weightless hold for soft and natural styles. Moroccanoil® Luminous Hairspray Medium is a lightweight and workable hairspray that veils hair in a reflective shield of shine that fights frizz and humidity, yet brushes out easily and leaves no sticky or flaky residue. Infused with a combination of advanced ingredients, including nourishing antioxidant-rich argan oil. Medium hold is ideal for natural styles, including easy updos (such as ballerina buns and ponytails) and blowouts. AWARDS Best High-Humidity Hairspray, InStyle.com, 2017 TotalBeauty Awards: Best Hair Products TotalBeauty.com, 2017','SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152-A, AQUA/WATER/EAU, OCTYLACRYLAMIDE/ACRYLATES/BUTYLAMINOETHYL METHACRYLATE COPOLYMER, POLYURETHANE-14, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, AMP-ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, C12-15 ALKYL BENZOATE, PANTHENOL, GLYCERIN, AMINOMETHYL PROPANOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, PEG-75 LANOLIN, PHENYL TRIMETHICONE, TRIETHYL CITRATE. MOLMUS02 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Hold Moroccanoil® Luminous Hairspray can 10 inches (25 cm) from hair and spray for medium hold. TIP: For extra volume, spray on roots before styling. Or for a fuller, texturized effect, use Moroccanoil® Root Boost.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/hairspray-medium',4.8,829,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/49_HAIR-SPRAY_MEDIUM_330mL_v2.jpg?v=1682737496','data/images/styling/luminous_hairspray_medium_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161093058777'),
('8161093091545','Luminous Hairspray Strong','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Moroccanoil® Luminous Hairspray Strong is a flexible hairspray for building long-lasting styles with movable yet strong hold. Its lightweight and workable finishing formula blankets hair in a reflective shield of shine that fights frizz and humidity, yet brushes out easily and leaves no flakey or sticky residue. Infused with a combination of advanced ingredients, including antioxidant-rich argan oil, this firm-hold finishing tool is ideal for creating up-styles, and can also be used as the foundation before braiding. AWARDS Winner, Glamour Beauty Awards Readers'' Choice, The Best Hairspray 2019 Winner, Total Beauty Award, 2018 Best High-Humidity Hairspray, InStyle.com, 2017 TotalBeauty Awards: Best Hair Products TotalBeauty.com, 2017','Moroccanoil® Luminous Hairspray Strong is a flexible hairspray for building long-lasting styles with movable yet strong hold. Its lightweight and workable finishing formula blankets hair in a reflective shield of shine that fights frizz and humidity, yet brushes out easily and leaves no flakey or sticky residue. Infused with a combination of advanced ingredients, including antioxidant-rich argan oil, this firm-hold finishing tool is ideal for creating up-styles, and can also be used as the foundation before braiding. AWARDS Winner, Glamour Beauty Awards Readers'' Choice, The Best Hairspray 2019 Winner, Total Beauty Award, 2018 Best High-Humidity Hairspray, InStyle.com, 2017 TotalBeauty Awards: Best Hair Products TotalBeauty.com, 2017','SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152A, VA/CROTONATES/VINYL NEODECANOATE COPOLYMER, OCTYLACRYLAMIDE/ACRYLATES/BUTYLAMINOETHYL METHACRYLATE COPOLYMER, UNDECANE, TRIDECANE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN)KERNEL OIL, HYDROGENATED OLIVE OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES, COCO-CAPRYLATE/CAPRATE, AMINOMETHYL PROPANOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, PEG-12 DIMETHICONE. MOLHSUS02 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Hold Moroccanoil® Luminous Hairspray can 10 inches (25 cm) from hair and spray for strong hold. TIP: For extra volume, spray on roots before styling. Or for a fuller, texturized effect, use Moroccanoil Root Boost.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/hairspray-strong',4.8,790,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/50_HAIR-SPRAY_STRONG_330mL_v2.jpg?v=1682737435','data/images/styling/luminous_hairspray_strong_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161093091545'),
('8161093124313','Mending Infusion','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Instantly seal split ends for a silky, fresh-cut appearance with Mending Infusion. This quick-fix finisher not only seals up to 90% of split ends, but also nourishes and helps strengthen hair to prevent future damage and treat weakened strands. Created for use on dry hair, the ultra-lightweight, fast-absorbing formula includes argan oil for a satin finish, larch tree extract to physically envelope strands and bind frayed ends, and a blend of naturally derived ingredients to help treat hair by strengthening, improving elasticity, and protecting against future breakage.','Instantly seal split ends for a silky, fresh-cut appearance with Mending Infusion. This quick-fix finisher not only seals up to 90% of split ends, but also nourishes and helps strengthen hair to prevent future damage and treat weakened strands. Created for use on dry hair, the ultra-lightweight, fast-absorbing formula includes argan oil for a satin finish, larch tree extract to physically envelope strands and bind frayed ends, and a blend of naturally derived ingredients to help treat hair by strengthening, improving elasticity, and protecting against future breakage.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, DIMETHICONE, GLYCERIN, CYCLOHEXASILOXANE, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, SQUALANE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROLYZED QUINOA, HYDROLYZED ADANSONIA DIGITATA SEED EXTRACT, CAMELLIA SINENSIS (GREEN TEA) LEAF EXTRACT, CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT, LAVANDULA ANGUSTIFOLIA (LAVENDER) FLOWER EXTRACT, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, COCONUT ALKANES, PEG-40 CASTOR OIL, GALACTOARABINAN, POLYSORBATE 60, DILINOLEIC ACID/PROPANEDIOL COPOLYMER, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, BENZOPHENONE-4, PANTHENOL, COCO-CAPRYLATE/CAPRATE, XYLITOL, ETHYL MACADAMIATE, CITRIC ACID, BENZOPHENONE-3, TOCOPHEROL, MALIC ACID, SULFURIC ACID, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PHENOXYETHANOL. MOMI01 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply a dime-sized amount between palms and work through dry hair, focusing on the ends. Reapply to dry and/or split ends to condition and bind as needed.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/mending-infusion',4.7,577,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/122_STYLE-FINISHER_MENDING-INFUSION_75mL_v2.jpg?v=1683622283','data/images/styling/mending_infusion_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161093124313'),
('8161093222617','Molding Cream','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Shape, sculpt and design perfectly texturized hair. From backstage looks to street-inspired styles, Moroccanoil® Molding Cream is a workable, pliable styling cream infused with thickening fibers that create natural-looking texture and definition for multiple styles. Enriched with argan oil to hydrate and nourish, it provides on-the-go hair styling with structure, long-lasting flexible hold and a semi-matte finish.','Shape, sculpt and design perfectly texturized hair. From backstage looks to street-inspired styles, Moroccanoil® Molding Cream is a workable, pliable styling cream infused with thickening fibers that create natural-looking texture and definition for multiple styles. Enriched with argan oil to hydrate and nourish, it provides on-the-go hair styling with structure, long-lasting flexible hold and a semi-matte finish.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, SYNTHETIC BEESWAX, GLYCERIN, PALMITIC ACID, DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, STEARETH-2, STEARYL ALCOHOL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, POLYQUATERNIUM-11, ACRYLATES/PALMETH-25 ACRYLATE COPOLYMER, BEHENAMIDOPROPYL DIMETHYLAMINE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, PEG-100 STEARATE, PEG-12 DIMETHICONE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, HYDROGENATED OLIVE OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES, CELLULOSE, HYDROXYETHYLCELLULOSE, GLUCOSE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, POLYQUATERNIUM-55, PEG-90M, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, MYRISTIC ACID, STEARIC ACID, SODIUM ACETATE, TRIETHANOLAMINE, CHLORPHENESIN, PHENOXYETHANOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, CARVONE, CAMPHOR, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS OIL, HEXAMETHYLINDANOPYRAN, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL, LAVANDULA (LAVENDER) OIL/EXTRACT, ISOEUGENYL ACETATE, LINALOOL, LINALYL ACETATE, MENTHA VIRIDIS (SPEARMINT) LEAF OIL, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, VANILLIN. MOMC04','To style short hair, warm Moroccanoil® Molding Cream in hands and work into damp or dry hair using fingertips to create desired look. For long, layered cuts, distribute cream throughout dry hair, avoiding the roots for an undone tousled look or to accent layers. For added dimension and separation, apply molding cream to fingertips and pull out end pieces.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/molding-cream',4.7,162,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/MOLDING_CREAM_75ML_v3_CROP_SRGB190.jpg?v=1777926146','data/images/styling/molding_cream_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161093222617'),
('8161093451993','Perfect Defense Heat Protectant','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Moroccanoil Perfect Defense is a weightless, dry aerosol, heat protective spray. This nourishing, argan oil and vitamin-fueled formula re-hydrates the hair while protecting against the damaging effects of heat styling up to 450°F/230°C. Winner, 2018 Glamour Beauty Awards, The Best Pro Leave-In, Glamour , 2018 Winner, Health Beauty Award, Must-Have Haircare Product, Influenster.com, 2018 Winner, Reviewer''s Choice Awards: Best in Beauty, Health Beauty Award, Influenster.com, 2018','Moroccanoil Perfect Defense is a weightless, dry aerosol, heat protective spray. This nourishing, argan oil and vitamin-fueled formula re-hydrates the hair while protecting against the damaging effects of heat styling up to 450°F/230°C. Winner, 2018 Glamour Beauty Awards, The Best Pro Leave-In, Glamour , 2018 Winner, Health Beauty Award, Must-Have Haircare Product, Influenster.com, 2018 Winner, Reviewer''s Choice Awards: Best in Beauty, Health Beauty Award, Influenster.com, 2018','DIMETHYL ETHER, SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), AQUA/WATER/EAU, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, OCTYLACRYLAMIDE/ACRYLATES/BUTYLAMINOETHYL METHACRYLATE COPOLYMER, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, ACHILLEA MILLEFOLIUM (COMMON YARROW) EXTRACT, GERANIUM MACULATUM (SPOTTED CRANESBILL) EXTRACT, LENTINUS EDODES (SHIITAKE MUSHROOM) EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) LEAF EXTRACT, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, AMINOMETHYL PROPANOL, PANTHENOL, CETEARAMIDOETHYLDIETHONIUM SUCCINOYL HYDROLYZED PEA PROTEIN, GLYCERIN, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, PPG-12 DIMETHICONE, HYDROXYPROPYL METHACRYLATE, BENZOIC ACID, LINALOOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE. MOPD01 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','For best results, use at the beginning of your styling routine before applying other products. Mist generously and evenly 6 inches away from damp hair. Comb through and blow-dry. Style with a hot tool. Use on dry hair for second-day touch ups.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/perfect-defense',4.7,3699,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/48_STYLE-FINISHER_PERFECT-DEFENSE_225mL_v3.jpg?v=1683622808','data/images/styling/perfect_defense_heat_protectant_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161093451993'),
('8161093583065','Protect & Prevent Spray','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Shield your haircolor from daily damage. Protect & Prevent Spray helps keep haircolor from fading or becoming brassy by protecting it from exposure to environmental factors that weaken the hair. Its comprehensive approach to combatting these sources of color degradation include: A blend of antioxidants to neutralize free radicals generated by UV, pollution and other stressors Sunscreens to help absorb UV rays Thermal protection against heat ArganIDTM technology to infuse argan oil into the hair''s cortex, sealing and repairing the hair In addition to protecting your color, it also weightlessly increases softness and shine with every use.','Shield your haircolor from daily damage. Protect & Prevent Spray helps keep haircolor from fading or becoming brassy by protecting it from exposure to environmental factors that weaken the hair. Its comprehensive approach to combatting these sources of color degradation include: A blend of antioxidants to neutralize free radicals generated by UV, pollution and other stressors Sunscreens to help absorb UV rays Thermal protection against heat ArganIDTM technology to infuse argan oil into the hair''s cortex, sealing and repairing the hair In addition to protecting your color, it also weightlessly increases softness and shine with every use.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, GLYCERIN, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED EXTRACT, CARRAGEENAN, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, XANTHAN GUM, SILICONE QUATERNIUM-22, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, BENZOPHENONE-4, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, POLYGLYCERYL-3 CAPRATE, CITRIC ACID, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, CARNOSINE, PALMITAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), BENZOPHENONE-3, C12-13 PARETH-9, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, ERGOTHIONEINE, ALGIN, CHITOSAN, COCO-GLUCOSIDE, SORBITAN OLEATE, GUAR HYDROXYPR