('8161094369497','Root Boost','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Lift roots for big volume. For full body volume and lift, Moroccanoil® Root Boost creates a strong texture at the roots before styling with heat. Infused with antioxidant-rich argan oil, this root lifter adds volume to medium to fine hair for long-lasting texture, body and movement. Our high-performance formula helps control static and provides a natural-looking finish.','Lift roots for big volume. For full body volume and lift, Moroccanoil® Root Boost creates a strong texture at the roots before styling with heat. Infused with antioxidant-rich argan oil, this root lifter adds volume to medium to fine hair for long-lasting texture, body and movement. Our high-performance formula helps control static and provides a natural-looking finish.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152A, DIMETHYL ETHER, VP/VA COPOLYMER, PVP, PEG-45 PALM KERNEL GLYCERIDES, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, POLYQUATERNIUM-7, BENZOPHENONE-4, TETRASODIUM EDTA, PPG-5-CETETH-20, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CARBOMER, AMINOMETHYL PROPANOL, POLYSORBATE 20, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, LINALOOL, LIMONENE. MORBNTHFC01 AQUA/WATER/EAU, HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152A, DIMETHYL ETHER, VP/VA COPOLYMER, PVP, PEG-45 PALM KERNEL GLYCERIDES, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, POLYQUATERNIUM-7, BENZOPHENONE-4, TETRASODIUM EDTA, PPG-5-CETETH-20, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CARBOMER, AMINOMETHYL PROPANOL, POLYSORBATE 20, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE. MORBNTHFC02 Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.</p>','Shake can well. Spray Moroccanoil® Root Boost generously on towel-dried hair at the roots. Using a round brush, blow-dry in sections, lifting hair away from the scalp. TIP: For enhanced body and movement, use Moroccanoil Volumizing Mousse along with Moroccanoil Root Boost prior to blow-drying and styling.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/root-boost-spray',4.8,594,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/53_STYLE-FINISHER_ROOT-BOOST_250mL_v3.jpg?v=1682737674','data/images/styling/root_boost_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161094369497'),
('9719292690649','Sculpting Pomade','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','A classic, water-based pomade enriched with argan oil that locks in styles all day long and washes out easily in the shower. Perfect for creating trending slicked-back styles on long or short hair, it provides a sleek, high-shine finish that adds polish to any hairstyle. Offering an optimal balance of control and flexibility, this hydrating styler keeps your hair in place all day without feeling stiff or greasy. • 94% agreed the product has all-day hold* • 98% agreed the product easily rinses out of hair* • 96% agreed the product is residue-free on hair* *Based on an independent consumer study.','94% agreed the product has all-day hold*; 98% agreed the product easily rinses out of hair*; 96% agreed the product is residue-free on hair*; Based on an independent consumer study.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETEARETH-20, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, PEG-7 GLYCERYL COCOATE, POLYSORBATE 20, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TETRASODIUM GLUTAMATE DIACETATE, MICA, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, CI 77891 (TITANIUM DIOXIDE), CI 42090 (BLUE 1), LINALOOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, HEXAMETHYLINDANOPYRAN, LINALYL ACETATE, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, VANILLIN, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS OIL, LAVANDULA (LAVENDER) OIL/EXTRACT, MENTHA VIRIDIS (SPEARMINT) LEAF OIL, ISOEUGENYL ACETATE, CAMPHOR, CARVONE. MOSP01','Rub a small amount between palms and distribute evenly through damp or dry hair. Stylist Tip: Use to create a slicked-back ponytail for all-day, frizz-free hold and smooth with a boar bristle brush for a flawless finish.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/sculpting-pomade',0,6,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/SCULPTINGPOMADE75ML_v3_CROP_SRGB190.jpg?v=1777924243','data/images/styling/sculpting_pomade_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-9719292690649'),
('8161094795481','Smoothing Lotion','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','This nourishing yet lightweight styling cream tames frizz and flyaways for all-day smoothness and definition. It is infused with argan oil, argan butter, Vitamin E, and essential fatty acids to condition dry hair, leaving it touchably soft and noticeably sleek. Ideal for curly, medium, and coarse hair types. Leaves hair 58% smoother* Reduces breakage by 72%* Fragranced with the signature Moroccanoil scent, a Mediterranean-inspired blend of spicy amber and sweet floral notes. *Results based on an independent lab study.','Results based on an independent lab study.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CYCLOMETHICONE, DIMETHICONE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCERIN, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, POLYQUATERNIUM-70, POLYQUATERNIUM-11, STEARETH-2, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE OIL, TILIA TOMENTOSA BUD EXTRACT, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, GLYCERYL STEARATE, CITRIC ACID, OLETH-10, CHLORPHENESIN, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, CI 26100 (RED 17), CI 47000 (YELLOW 11), ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL, BENZYL BENZOATE. MOSL04','Apply a small amount to damp hair. Style as desired. Use as a leave-in, next-day refresher.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/smoothing-lotion',4.8,984,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/43_STYLE-FINISHER_SMOOTHING-LOTION-FRIZZ_300mL_v1.jpg?v=1692721774','data/images/styling/smoothing_lotion_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161094795481'),
('8161094926553','Styling Gel - Strong','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','This flexible, hydrating styling gel for sleek and structured looks with long-lasting, strong hold. Moroccanoil® Styling Gel Strong creates texture and piecey definition for both wet and dry styles. Its argan oil-infused, alcohol-free formula shapes and nourishes while leaving hair shiny and touchable for a flake-free finish.','This flexible, hydrating styling gel for sleek and structured looks with long-lasting, strong hold. Moroccanoil® Styling Gel Strong creates texture and piecey definition for both wet and dry styles. Its argan oil-infused, alcohol-free formula shapes and nourishes while leaving hair shiny and touchable for a flake-free finish.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, POLYACRYLATE-2 CROSSPOLYMER, AMINOMETHYL PROPANOL, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, ALOE BARBADENSIS (ALOE VERA) LEAF JUICE, CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, TOCOPHEROL, CITRIC ACID, PANTHENOL, POLYSORBATE 20, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, CHLORPHENESIN, PHENOXYETHANOL. Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply desired amount of Moroccanoil® Styling Gel Strong to damp or dry hair and style as usual.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/styling-gel-strong',4.7,199,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/42_STYLE-FINISHER_STYLING-GEL-STRONG_180mL_v2.jpg?v=1683623011','data/images/styling/styling_gel_-_strong_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161094926553'),
('9217377763545','Texture & Volume Hair Powder','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Moroccanoil Texture & Volume Powder delivers instant volume, uplifting strands and enhancing any style at the root. This high-performing powder adds grip and texture for effortless styling, maximum concentrated volume, and long-lasting flexible hold. To reactivate the volume benefits throughout the day, simply tousle the hair. This will ensure that the hair stays voluminous and looking great all day, even after initial application of the product. It won’t weigh down the hair or leave it feeling sticky, making it the ideal product for fine, thin, or flat hair. • Lightweight formula for touchable results • Natural-looking, semi-matte finish • Buildable results • Tousle hair to reactivate • Deodorizes, leaving behind the signature Moroccanoil scent Results based on consumer and instrumental testing after one use: • 48 hours of long-lasting lift 1 • 98% agree hair has instant body and root lift 2 • 98% agree hair doesn’t feel sticky, crunchy, or stiff 2 • 93% agree this product revives limp and flat hair 2 1 Based on results of an independent lab study. 2 Based on results of a consumer study','Lightweight formula for touchable results; Natural-looking, semi-matte finish; Buildable results; Tousle hair to reactivate; Deodorizes, leaving behind the signature Moroccanoil scent; 48 hours of long-lasting lift; 98% agree hair has instant body and root lift; 98% agree hair doesn’t feel sticky, crunchy, or stiff; 93% agree this product revives limp and flat hair','AQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, SILICA SILYLATE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, LINALOOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, HEXAMETHYLINDANOPYRAN, LINALYL ACETATE, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, VANILLIN, LAVANDULA (LAVENDER) OIL/EXTRACT, ISOEUGENYL ACETATE. MOT&VP01','Section hair. Hold bottle 4–6 inches away from dry roots. Gently press on pump to disperse. Start with one pump, adding more to build volume as needed. Style with fingers until desired result is achieved. Tousle hair to reactivate volume throughout the day.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/texture-volume-hair-powder',4.5,60,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/STYLE-FINISHER_TEXTURE-VOLUME-POWDER_v3_CROP_1.jpg?v=1751297006','data/images/styling/texture_volume_hair_powder_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-9217377763545'),
('8161094959321','Texture Clay','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','A workable clay that defines and sculpts to create natural looks with a matte finish and medium hold. Moroccanoil® Texture Clay features a blend of argan oil, shea butter and bentonite clay for piecey, roughed-up styles. Achieve customizable versatility—this unisex hair clay allows for time to style before the hold sets in to build to a desired level of texture for both short and long hair. Tames and controls frizz all day and leaves behind a non-sticky, non-greasy finish.','A workable clay that defines and sculpts to create natural looks with a matte finish and medium hold. Moroccanoil® Texture Clay features a blend of argan oil, shea butter and bentonite clay for piecey, roughed-up styles. Achieve customizable versatility—this unisex hair clay allows for time to style before the hold sets in to build to a desired level of texture for both short and long hair. Tames and controls frizz all day and leaves behind a non-sticky, non-greasy finish.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, VP/VA COPOLYMER, BENTONITE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, GLYCERIN, CETYL PALMITATE, GLYCERYL STEARATE SE, SYNTHETIC BEESWAX, TRIBEHENIN, PEG-40 CASTOR OIL, C18-36 ACID TRIGLYCERIDE, HYDROGENATED SOYBEAN OIL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, C32-36 ISOALKYL STEARATE, PVP, POLYHYDROXYSTEARIC ACID, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, ALOE BARBADENSIS (ALOE VERA) LEAF JUICE POWDER, CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT, ECHINACEA PURPUREA (PURPLE CONEFLOWER) EXTRACT, GERANIUM MACULATUM (SPOTTED CRANESBILL) EXTRACT, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, HYDRATED SILICA, STEARYL BEHENATE, DIHEPTYL SUCCINATE, BEHENTRIMONIUM METHOSULFATE, POLYGLYCERYL-3 STEARATE, CAPRYLOYL GLYCERIN/SEBACIC ACID COPOLYMER, NYLON-12, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, POLYSORBATE 60, PHENOXYETHANOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, LAURTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, IRON OXIDES (CI 77492, CI 77499, CI 77491), LINALOOL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, CAMPHOR, CARVONE, HEXAMETHYLINDANOPYRAN, LINALYL ACETATE, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, VANILLIN, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS OIL, LAVANDULA (LAVENDER) OIL/EXTRACT, MENTHA VIRIDIS (SPEARMINT) LEAF OIL, ISOEUGENYL ACETATE. MOTC03','Rub a small amount between palms and distribute evenly through damp or dry hair.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/texture-clay',4.7,161,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/TEXTURE_CLAY_75ML_v3_CROP_SRGB190.jpg?v=1777925702','data/images/styling/texture_clay_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161094959321'),
('8161094992089','Thickening Lotion','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Fast-track to instant fullness! Moroccanoil® Thickening Lotion strengthens hair with quinoa proteins and thickens each individual strand for instant expansion and long-lasting body. This unique hair lotion is formulated with a blend of vitamins and argan oil that moisturizes for touchable, shiny hair without stickiness. AWARD Best Beauty Product, OK! Magazine, 2016','Fast-track to instant fullness! Moroccanoil® Thickening Lotion strengthens hair with quinoa proteins and thickens each individual strand for instant expansion and long-lasting body. This unique hair lotion is formulated with a blend of vitamins and argan oil that moisturizes for touchable, shiny hair without stickiness. AWARD Best Beauty Product, OK! Magazine, 2016','AQUA/WATER/EAU, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCERIN, PVP, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), DIMETHICONE, CETEARYL OLIVATE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, HYDROLYZED QUINOA, COCONUT ALKANES, CAMELLIA SINENSIS (GREEN TEA) LEAF EXTRACT, CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT, GERANIUM MACULATUM EXTRACT, LAVANDULA ANGUSTIFOLIA (LAVENDER) FLOWER EXTRACT, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, COCO-CAPRYLATE/CAPRATE, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PEG-12 DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, SORBITAN OLIVATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, BEHENTRIMONIUM METHOSULFATE, OLEALKONIUM CHLORIDE, POLYQUATERNIUM-55, XYLITOL, HYDROXYETHYLCELLULOSE, BENZOPHENONE-4, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, PANTHENOL, PEG-12, POLYQUATERNIUM-7, GLYOXAL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, CITRIC ACID, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, PHENOXYETHANOL. Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Apply a quarter-sized amount of Moroccanoil® Thickening Lotion between palms. Distribute through damp hair from root to tip and blow-dry as usual.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/thickening-lotion',4.7,354,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/105_STYLE-FINISHER_THICKENING-LOTION_100mL_v4.jpg?v=1683766367','data/images/styling/thickening_lotion_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161094992089'),
('8161095090393','Volumizing Mist','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Spritz life back into fine, dull hair with Volumizing Mist. This weightless, body-building mist lifts hair for a look that''s up to 50% fuller, while maintaining movement and touchable hold from root to tip. The argan oil-infused formula includes Rice Amino Acids to help fortify and strengthen the hair, plus Dead Sea Salt to build volume with bouncy texture. Increased volume lasts for up to 72 hours.','Spritz life back into fine, dull hair with Volumizing Mist. This weightless, body-building mist lifts hair for a look that''s up to 50% fuller, while maintaining movement and touchable hold from root to tip. The argan oil-infused formula includes Rice Amino Acids to help fortify and strengthen the hair, plus Dead Sea Salt to build volume with bouncy texture. Increased volume lasts for up to 72 hours.','SD ALCOHOL 40-B (ALCOHOL DENAT.), AQUA/WATER/EAU, VP/VA COPOLYMER, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, POLYSORBATE 20, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, LAVANDULA ANGUSTIFOLIA (LAVENDER) FLOWER EXTRACT, CAMELLIA SINENSIS (GREEN TEA) LEAF EXTRACT, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, HYDROLYZED QUINOA, RICE AMINO ACIDS, WHEAT AMINO ACIDS, SOY AMINO ACIDS, ARGININE HCL, SERINE, THREONINE, ALGIN, CHITOSAN, PULLULAN, TREHALOSE, XYLITYLGLUCOSIDE, ANHYDROXYLITOL, XYLITOL, SORBITOL, GLUCOSE, SEA SALT/MARIS SAL, GALACTOARABINAN, GLYCERIN, PANTHENOL, POLYQUATERNIUM-11, POLYQUATERNIUM-16, C12-13 PARETH-9, CITRIC ACID, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, PROPANEDIOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CINNAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PHENOXYETHANOL.','Mist generously throughout clean, towel-dried hair from roots to ends. Blow-dry.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/volumizing-mist',4.8,286,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/108_STYLE-FINISHER_VOLUMIZING-MIST_160mL_v2.jpg?v=1682737816','data/images/styling/volumizing_mist_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161095090393'),
('8161095123161','Volumizing Mousse','Moroccanoil','hairstyling','hairstyling','Give your hair instant volume and lift with Moroccanoil® Volumizing Mousse for medium to fine hair. This weightless styling volumizer builds body and creates lift without stickiness. Our flake-free formula with medium, flexible hold provides a "memory" factor, for natural-looking styles that last longer. Infused with antioxidant-rich argan oil and an anti-static agent for supremely manageable and silky hair.','Give your hair instant volume and lift with Moroccanoil® Volumizing Mousse for medium to fine hair. This weightless styling volumizer builds body and creates lift without stickiness. Our flake-free formula with medium, flexible hold provides a "memory" factor, for natural-looking styles that last longer. Infused with antioxidant-rich argan oil and an anti-static agent for supremely manageable and silky hair.','AQUA/WATER/EAU, ISOBUTANE, HYDROFLUOROCARBON 152A, POLYQUATERNIUM-4, POLYSORBATE 20 PROPANE, SOYTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE Disclaimer: Ingredients listed may vary slightly from products received. Before use, refer to packaging for most up-to-date in ingredient information and any warnings or instructions.','Shake can well. Invert can and apply a palm-sized amount of Moroccanoil® Volumizing Mousse on towel-dried hair, combing fingers through. For maximum body, texture and lift, use in tandem with Moroccanoil Root Boost. Blow-dry with a round brush starting at the roots. TIP: For enhanced body and movement, use Moroccanoil Volumizing Mousse along with Moroccanoil Root Boost prior to blow-drying and styling.','https://www.moroccanoil.com/products/volumizing-mousse',4.7,564,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5540/0921/files/52_STYLE-FINISHER_VOLUMIZING-MOUSSE_250mL_v3.jpg?v=1682737557','data/images/styling/volumizing_mousse_01.jpg',1,1,1,'Tạo kiểu tóc','HC-8161095123161');
